From d11f546d2adc7a520ec23d4f7a3f54245bb453d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:30:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/34] ChopGimp: Photoshop transform controls around the
 content in the move tool

The move tool draws a box with handles around the visible content of the
selected layer; dragging a handle fits the layer to its content and hands
the drag over to the unified transform tool, which returns to the move
tool on commit or cancel. Ctrl+T also fits the layer to its content first.
